/RV (<?xml version="1.0"?><body xfa:APIVersion="Acroform:2.7.0.0" xfa:spec="2.1" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/"><p dir="ltr" style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12pt">Must use fall 2025and spring 2026 student research as the beginning point for the spring 2026 semester.</p><p dir="ltr" style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12pt">Must have familiarity a comfortability working with artificial intelligent.</p><p dir="ltr" style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12pt">These results may be integrated into a larger project.<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes">&#160;&#160; </span></p></body>)
